WEBVTT

00:00:11.110 --> 00:00:15.640
My right hand holds a bowl of gold,

00:00:15.640 --> 00:00:20.180
And my left holds one of silver.

00:00:20.180 --> 00:00:24.720
Never one without the other,

00:00:24.720 --> 00:00:37.800
Two unseen bowls for each of us.

00:00:37.800 --> 00:00:46.210
The golden one is filled with joy,

00:00:46.210 --> 00:00:53.550
shining warmly.

00:00:53.550 --> 00:00:58.350
Since we met, my golden bowl

00:00:58.350 --> 00:01:05.360
cannot hold all my happiness and love.

00:01:07.100 --> 00:01:15.500
Golden joy, silver sadness,

00:01:15.500 --> 00:01:22.850
I would leave my past behind...

00:01:22.850 --> 00:01:27.580
For you, for the sake of love,

00:01:27.580 --> 00:01:34.520
I would empty the bowls of my past.

00:02:18.270 --> 00:02:21.070
My Dear Brother, I'm finally here!

00:02:21.200 --> 00:02:24.470
At your school, for the Gakuin University Fair.

00:02:31.610 --> 00:02:32.620
So many people!

00:02:32.750 --> 00:02:37.350
Yeah! University fairs are so different from the high school ones.

00:02:38.220 --> 00:02:39.560
This is so exciting!

00:02:43.160 --> 00:02:45.030
What's wrong, Mariko-san?

00:02:45.090 --> 00:02:45.900
What?

00:02:46.360 --> 00:02:49.230
You're so tense, especially your shoulders.

00:02:50.170 --> 00:02:52.170
And why not, after all?

00:02:52.700 --> 00:02:58.640
Protecting you two from all the males here is a grave responsibility.

00:02:59.200 --> 00:03:00.110
Let's go!

00:03:00.710 --> 00:03:02.510
What? But... wait a second!

00:03:02.780 --> 00:03:05.850
I don't remember anyone asking her for protection...!

00:03:07.120 --> 00:03:08.120
What was that?!

00:03:09.250 --> 00:03:10.250
There! They're here!

00:03:13.160 --> 00:03:15.330
Hi! Glad you're here!

00:03:16.790 --> 00:03:20.000
I'm very grateful that you sent me an invitation.

00:03:21.730 --> 00:03:24.270
My pleasure! Thanks for coming.

00:03:24.800 --> 00:03:28.410
May I present my friends, Shinobu Mariko-san and Arikura Tomoko-san.

00:03:29.150 --> 00:03:30.610
I'm Henmi Takehiko.

00:03:31.070 --> 00:03:33.080
How do... ...you do.

00:03:33.680 --> 00:03:35.680
Hi Henmi-sensei, it's been a long time!

00:03:36.080 --> 00:03:36.750
Huh?

00:03:37.080 --> 00:03:39.480
I was in the same cram school with Nanako.

00:03:39.480 --> 00:03:40.880
The name is Arikura.

00:03:41.690 --> 00:03:43.020
Oh! It's you!

00:03:43.020 --> 00:03:45.360
Sorry, we tagged along today.

00:03:45.490 --> 00:03:47.690
Oh, the more the merrier!

00:03:47.820 --> 00:03:50.760
Uh... This... this is my friend.

00:03:51.230 --> 00:03:53.300
I'm Ichinomiya Takashi. Glad to meet you.

00:03:56.970 --> 00:03:58.700
You said... Ichinomiya?

00:03:58.700 --> 00:04:00.300
So you are...

00:04:00.700 --> 00:04:03.170
Yes. He's Miya-sama's brother.

00:04:03.310 --> 00:04:04.240
Huh?

00:04:05.040 --> 00:04:06.640
Oh wow!

00:04:07.110 --> 00:04:10.380
I understand you all attend Seiran with my sister.

00:04:10.510 --> 00:04:13.180
Glad you came. Pleased to meet you.

00:04:16.520 --> 00:04:18.660
This is a typical "guy" strategy!

00:04:18.790 --> 00:04:21.790
They pretend to shake hands for "friendship",

00:04:21.790 --> 00:04:24.230
... but they're probably already planning their next move!

00:04:24.230 --> 00:04:25.060
Huh?

00:04:26.730 --> 00:04:30.400
Even if he's Miya-sama's brother, he's still a guy!

00:04:30.400 --> 00:04:32.140
So don't let down your guard.

00:04:34.740 --> 00:04:36.140
~ ~ ~ ~ ~ ~Bleah!~ ~ ~ ~ ~ ~

00:04:36.670 --> 00:04:42.480
21. The University Fair

00:04:44.450 --> 00:04:47.470
How about it? Where shall we start?

00:04:50.150 --> 00:04:51.490
How about the movies?

00:04:51.490 --> 00:04:54.290
Our university's movie study-group is highly regarded.

00:04:54.560 --> 00:04:56.030
Sounds interesting!

00:04:57.230 --> 00:04:59.430
Yeah! I want to see that!!

00:04:59.900 --> 00:05:01.830
No way! Movies, of all things!

00:05:02.430 --> 00:05:04.040
How obvious can you get?

00:05:04.040 --> 00:05:07.770
Movies, as you well know, are shown in dark rooms!

00:05:16.380 --> 00:05:18.850
And now for some magic with cards.

00:05:18.920 --> 00:05:22.320
There is a gorgeous lady in our midst, with a diamond ring,

00:05:22.320 --> 00:05:26.860
... my heart is on fire. Our love is in spades!

00:05:27.260 --> 00:05:28.990
Watch out, both of you.

00:05:30.260 --> 00:05:30.800
Huh?

00:05:30.800 --> 00:05:32.530
Huh? Using this type of comedy...

00:05:32.530 --> 00:05:34.930
...it's an attempt to put us at ease.

00:05:35.200 --> 00:05:37.140
That should be obvious to anyone!

00:05:39.940 --> 00:05:46.480
Here is a 140 to 1 scale model of Neutschvanstein Castle in Germany.

00:05:46.810 --> 00:05:48.280
Very well made.

00:05:48.480 --> 00:05:50.880
Rudreich the 2nd had it built in the 17th century.

00:05:50.880 --> 00:05:52.900
It took him 17 years...

00:05:52.900 --> 00:05:54.150
What an amateur you are!

00:05:54.550 --> 00:05:58.620
...showing off knowledge, using a woman's feelings of inferiority...

00:05:58.620 --> 00:05:59.960
...anyone can see through that!

00:06:05.900 --> 00:06:08.970
A Haunted House! It looks like fun!

00:06:09.300 --> 00:06:10.570
A Haunted house?

00:06:11.370 --> 00:06:13.710
I haven't been in one since Junior High.

00:06:14.640 --> 00:06:17.240
Shall we try it? It'll bring back memories.

00:06:17.600 --> 00:06:20.110
Yes! I love these things!

00:06:20.250 --> 00:06:23.780
Shinobu-san, don't you dare oppose this one...!

00:06:24.120 --> 00:06:28.720
I won't oppose it, but, let's separate into two groups...

00:06:28.720 --> 00:06:31.520
Males go with males and females go with females.

00:06:38.000 --> 00:06:40.070
This is sort of scary!

00:06:40.530 --> 00:06:44.070
That's why we should have had them come with us.

00:06:44.070 --> 00:06:45.670
Don't you get it?

00:06:45.670 --> 00:06:49.880
They'd only invite girls into a place like this if they had ulterior motives.

00:06:50.080 --> 00:06:51.280
Ulterior motives?

00:06:51.740 --> 00:06:53.410
What sort of "ulterior motive"?

00:06:56.280 --> 00:07:02.290
I'd rather hug the ghost than them, in this panic and confusion...

00:07:02.290 --> 00:07:04.890
This is just an old familiar trick.

00:07:09.090 --> 00:07:10.500
So what do YOU want?

00:07:19.370 --> 00:07:21.370
Help me!!

00:07:25.440 --> 00:07:27.310
Uh... Are you OK?

00:07:27.910 --> 00:07:28.710
Uh...

00:07:29.050 --> 00:07:31.580
Aieeeee..!

00:07:34.050 --> 00:07:36.920
I've never been so humiliated in my life!

00:07:37.190 --> 00:07:40.990
Humiliated? Wasn't it YOU that ran into me?

00:07:41.130 --> 00:07:44.150
You shouldn't have been there!

00:07:44.150 --> 00:07:48.000
And look, why do you have to sit so close to me?

00:07:48.470 --> 00:07:50.000
Move further away.

00:07:50.350 --> 00:07:51.800
Oh...sorry...

00:07:51.800 --> 00:07:52.350
Further!

00:07:52.760 --> 00:07:53.670
Yes, Ma-am...

00:07:53.850 --> 00:07:54.810
Further!

00:07:57.010 --> 00:07:59.610
Mariko-san! Please behave yourself!

00:08:02.480 --> 00:08:04.350
Umm... listen...!

00:08:04.880 --> 00:08:05.750
What is it??

00:08:05.950 --> 00:08:10.560
Your vigilance in this respect is truly admirable,

00:08:10.560 --> 00:08:12.630
...but come on, let's relax and have some fun.

00:08:12.630 --> 00:08:14.830
This is our University Fair!

00:08:15.000 --> 00:08:17.360
I didn't come here to have fun!

00:08:18.560 --> 00:08:22.370
I came here to protect Nanako-san and Tomoko-san!

00:08:22.640 --> 00:08:24.040
I'm completely at a loss.

00:08:24.500 --> 00:08:27.040
Why do you hate men so much?

00:08:28.110 --> 00:08:32.850
They are selfish... dirty... and the cruelest creatures on earth.

00:08:33.800 --> 00:08:36.650
How can you say all men are like that?

00:08:37.320 --> 00:08:39.120
How can you say they're not!

00:08:39.650 --> 00:08:41.450
I can certainly say that I'M not!

00:08:41.790 --> 00:08:44.720
It's true! Men are all talk but no deed!

00:08:46.530 --> 00:08:47.990
Henmi!

00:08:57.400 --> 00:09:01.010
It's time to meet and be heard!

00:09:01.010 --> 00:09:03.940
Assemble with us to defend our cultural heritage.

00:09:03.940 --> 00:09:06.610
Exercise your constitutional right to free speech!

00:09:18.960 --> 00:09:21.960
Doesn't it seem like there are more people here, now?

00:09:22.100 --> 00:09:24.550
At 2 o'clock there's a concert in the gym.

00:09:25.630 --> 00:09:27.830
It's an amateur band, and fairly popular.

00:09:28.100 --> 00:09:29.900
A rock group. Do you want to go?

00:09:30.100 --> 00:09:30.950
Yes!

00:09:31.440 --> 00:09:35.440
I know them! They're "Mercury"! I love them!

00:09:40.850 --> 00:09:42.120
Would you like a balloon?

00:09:42.780 --> 00:09:45.920
No. Balloons always burst, and too soon.

00:09:46.390 --> 00:09:48.920
So, you dislike things that don't last?

00:09:49.390 --> 00:09:51.460
You're a delicate one, aren't you.

00:09:51.790 --> 00:09:53.190
And you're pretentious.

00:09:59.130 --> 00:10:00.070
Look! <i></i>

00:10:00.070 --> 00:10:01.000
Look! What?

00:10:01.000 --> 00:10:01.870
Look! What?  Huh?

00:10:05.740 --> 00:10:07.940
What happened to them?

00:10:08.480 --> 00:10:09.480
They're lost?

00:10:09.740 --> 00:10:11.880
I wonder if Mariko-san is OK?

00:10:12.080 --> 00:10:15.220
She'll be OK. She's with Ichinomiya-san.

00:10:15.350 --> 00:10:17.890
Now we can have some fun.

00:10:18.820 --> 00:10:19.820
Hey!

00:10:20.550 --> 00:10:23.020
Please! Slow down!

00:10:24.020 --> 00:10:26.360
Can't you please stop following me!

00:10:26.490 --> 00:10:28.100
I can't leave you alone!

00:10:28.360 --> 00:10:30.700
I'm responsible for you!

00:10:30.830 --> 00:10:34.230
Until I find Henmi and the others, I'm your bodyguard!

00:10:35.440 --> 00:10:37.300
I'll have nothing of the sort!

00:10:37.640 --> 00:10:42.180
If not a bodyguard, then, consider me a "practice date".

00:10:43.040 --> 00:10:44.580
You make my flesh crawl.

00:10:44.780 --> 00:10:45.910
All right then, all right.

00:10:46.450 --> 00:10:49.050
By the way, where were you going?

00:10:49.450 --> 00:10:53.050
To the public address booth. I'll have them page Nanako-san.

00:10:53.250 --> 00:10:57.660
Not in this auxiliary buildings. That would be in the main building.

00:10:58.060 --> 00:10:59.330
What?

00:10:59.790 --> 00:11:05.330
Besides... during school fairs, they don't make announcements.

00:11:53.850 --> 00:11:56.180
Stay at least one meter away from me.

00:11:56.380 --> 00:11:58.250
That won't be easy...

00:11:58.250 --> 00:12:00.990
Any further away from you, and we might be separated too.

00:12:00.990 --> 00:12:04.590
If we get separated, that'll suit me fine.

00:12:04.780 --> 00:12:05.830
Now, now...

00:12:06.620 --> 00:12:08.000
Ichinomiya-san!

00:12:08.700 --> 00:12:09.530
Hi!

00:12:09.730 --> 00:12:11.470
A friend. In my class.

00:12:11.870 --> 00:12:12.930
Is that so?

00:12:19.670 --> 00:12:20.940
Ichinomiya-sempai!

00:12:21.480 --> 00:12:25.010
Why don't you try shooting? I'll give you a discount.

00:12:25.280 --> 00:12:26.610
Sure. But later.

00:12:27.220 --> 00:12:29.950
She's in my ski club.

00:12:31.220 --> 00:12:32.490
Hey, it's been a while!

00:12:32.900 --> 00:12:34.000
Hi! How have you been?

00:12:34.260 --> 00:12:37.090
And this lovely lady... your girlfriend?

00:12:42.700 --> 00:12:43.900
We're complete strangers.

00:12:44.360 --> 00:12:45.430
Well, see you later.

00:12:45.830 --> 00:12:47.240
Uhh... sure!

00:12:56.910 --> 00:12:59.450
You certainly have a lot of female friends.

00:12:59.580 --> 00:13:05.280
Oh? Oh! Uh... I guess... you know, being a university student...

00:13:05.790 --> 00:13:07.860
All men are like that.

00:13:07.970 --> 00:13:10.190
They can't be satisfied with just one girl.

00:13:10.460 --> 00:13:12.390
You're prejudiced.

00:13:12.790 --> 00:13:16.930
I'd be very happy with one girl. But I need to have friends also.

00:13:19.270 --> 00:13:23.610
Whatever you're male or female, try to make a friend whenever you can.

00:13:26.680 --> 00:13:28.600
Don't presume to give me advice.

00:13:28.600 --> 00:13:29.600
Oh yeah?

00:13:31.120 --> 00:13:32.060
Yes!

00:13:34.480 --> 00:13:37.890
What else looks interesting?

00:13:38.480 --> 00:13:41.160
We've seen most of them...

00:13:41.490 --> 00:13:43.490
We had so much fun! Really!

00:13:44.030 --> 00:13:47.230
Yeah! This was our first university fair!

00:13:47.230 --> 00:13:49.300
It's been so exciting!

00:13:49.500 --> 00:13:54.440
In three years, you may be the ones putting on a fair.

00:13:54.500 --> 00:13:55.770
What? Huh?

00:13:56.040 --> 00:13:57.570
Is that too far ahead to think about?

00:13:57.840 --> 00:14:00.780
Yes. It's just too distant in the future.

00:14:00.980 --> 00:14:02.980
Wow... three years!

00:14:02.980 --> 00:14:06.380
I could be walking hand in hand with my boyfriend...

00:14:07.320 --> 00:14:11.990
By the way, do you have a girlfriend, Henmi-san?

00:14:13.920 --> 00:14:14.590
What?

00:14:17.330 --> 00:14:21.370
I must admit, it hadn't occurred to me before...

00:14:21.370 --> 00:14:24.600
... but it wouldn't surprise me if my Brother has a girlfriend.

00:14:26.900 --> 00:14:31.430
Oh, I'm sorry...! Was that an improper question?

00:14:31.810 --> 00:14:34.540
No girlfriend. Not right now.

00:14:34.810 --> 00:14:35.950
Satisfied?

00:14:37.210 --> 00:14:41.020
Well! You dodged that one! A different subject, then.

00:14:41.020 --> 00:14:44.420
How did you come to select this university?

00:14:44.620 --> 00:14:47.290
Well, now... in order to answer that question...

00:14:48.360 --> 00:14:50.890
I gave you an easy one, this time!

00:14:51.830 --> 00:14:53.900
That's right, my dear Brother.

00:14:54.630 --> 00:14:59.440
I really don't know anything about you.

00:15:01.240 --> 00:15:04.550
I wrote you so many long letters,

00:15:04.550 --> 00:15:06.910
...they must've been a burden to you.

00:15:07.380 --> 00:15:10.450
But I've only been thinking of myself.

00:15:11.980 --> 00:15:15.990
You're such a considerate and gentle person.

00:15:16.850 --> 00:15:20.590
Taking advantage of your generosity... is not very nice.

00:15:20.790 --> 00:15:23.080
It's wrong of me, it really is.

00:15:26.060 --> 00:15:30.130
Cotton candy! It looks so good!

00:15:31.000 --> 00:15:33.470
I'll go get some for you, too!

00:15:38.740 --> 00:15:39.800
Thinking about something?

00:15:39.800 --> 00:15:40.680
Huh?

00:15:40.680 --> 00:15:42.880
You've been so quiet.

00:15:43.280 --> 00:15:46.150
Oh! That was just...

00:15:46.950 --> 00:15:49.290
I was just starting to worry a bit...

00:15:49.420 --> 00:15:50.450
Worry?

00:15:50.890 --> 00:15:55.430
Yes... It was selfish of me to make you be my "Brother".

00:15:56.690 --> 00:16:00.230
You must be terribly busy with your studies, and everything else..

00:16:01.430 --> 00:16:04.370
And so I'm worried...

00:16:04.370 --> 00:16:07.040
...that I've become a burden to you.

00:16:07.370 --> 00:16:10.510
A burden? I never thought of it that way.

00:16:11.380 --> 00:16:15.910
Reading your letters reminds me of my own high school days.

00:16:17.310 --> 00:16:22.650
Back then, the most trivial things could make me happy or angry.

00:16:23.320 --> 00:16:27.260
Your letters bring all those feelings back to me.

00:16:29.790 --> 00:16:33.530
Now, I look forward to checking my mailbox.

00:16:33.530 --> 00:16:34.800
Really?

00:16:34.800 --> 00:16:38.200
Really! It's true. Speaking of which...

00:16:38.500 --> 00:16:40.470
Huh? Yes?

00:16:40.740 --> 00:16:42.940
When's the next letter?

00:16:49.900 --> 00:16:53.150
Where could they have gone?

00:16:55.090 --> 00:16:58.760
In a crowd like this, it'll be next to impossible to find them.

00:17:00.760 --> 00:17:03.960
It's like looking for a contact lens in a swimming pool.

00:17:08.170 --> 00:17:12.440
But it's OK. We can always just wait for them at the main gate.

00:17:12.970 --> 00:17:16.440
Look over here... Don't girls love this sort of things?

00:17:17.580 --> 00:17:19.040
It's all nonsense!

00:17:19.240 --> 00:17:23.910
Really? It looks fun! Whether it's true or not.

00:17:31.060 --> 00:17:33.460
But... I guess I'll try it anyway.

00:17:38.930 --> 00:17:40.600
You are strong-willed.

00:17:41.800 --> 00:17:44.600
Is it strong will, or just a "hard-head"?

00:17:44.740 --> 00:17:45.610
Shut up!

00:17:46.200 --> 00:17:49.940
You are bright, and you have good luck with money.

00:17:50.070 --> 00:17:51.170
Except... <i> </i>

00:17:51.170 --> 00:17:52.340
Except... Except?

00:17:54.210 --> 00:17:56.610
Except there's a problem related to your family...

00:17:59.750 --> 00:18:01.290
Your parents are... <i> </i>

00:18:01.290 --> 00:18:02.350
Your parents are... Stop it!

00:18:03.020 --> 00:18:06.290
How did you... What do you know about it!

00:18:06.290 --> 00:18:08.100
I've had enough of this nonsense!

00:18:08.100 --> 00:18:10.300
Hey! Wait!

00:18:11.830 --> 00:18:12.760
300 Yen.

00:18:20.770 --> 00:18:22.040
Hey girl! You alone?

00:18:23.040 --> 00:18:24.910
How'd you like us to show you around?

00:18:25.510 --> 00:18:27.310
We're students here.

00:18:30.850 --> 00:18:34.190
Don't get uppity, now. Get that serious look off your face.

00:18:34.590 --> 00:18:38.060
Well, hey... there's a disco party at 5 o'clock.

00:18:38.390 --> 00:18:42.260
We wanted to go, 'cept for being just 2 guys alone...

00:18:42.660 --> 00:18:45.730
Hey, listen here, wait up!

00:18:47.470 --> 00:18:49.270
Let go of me!!

00:18:50.070 --> 00:18:52.870
Leave me alone!

00:18:52.870 --> 00:18:56.630
I can't stand to be touched by your filthy hands!

00:18:56.630 --> 00:18:58.480
I hate slime like you!

00:18:58.480 --> 00:19:01.550
Stop following me!! Get lost!!

00:19:01.680 --> 00:19:03.620
Get away from me RIGHT NOW!

00:19:23.770 --> 00:19:26.370
I'm sorry. I'm a failure as a bodyguard.

00:19:28.770 --> 00:19:30.710
Shall we go? Everyone's staring.

00:19:30.980 --> 00:19:34.850
Leave yourself, if you're so concerned about what they think.

00:19:34.850 --> 00:19:37.650
Or you can just stay and watch me like them.

00:19:46.590 --> 00:19:50.260
All right, I understand. I'll wait until you're ready.

00:20:02.070 --> 00:20:05.480
Let's go. This is foolish.

00:20:20.360 --> 00:20:21.560
Hey Henmi!

00:20:22.830 --> 00:20:23.700
Mariko-san!

00:20:24.100 --> 00:20:25.770
I figured you'd be here!

00:20:26.030 --> 00:20:29.970
Yes... when lost, one should backtrack to the point of origin.

00:20:30.500 --> 00:20:34.970
I'm so glad. I was worried that we'd never find you!

00:20:35.280 --> 00:20:37.710
You won't believe what happened... it was terrible.

00:20:39.310 --> 00:20:43.780
Since we're finally back together, why don't we go for some coffee?

00:20:44.050 --> 00:20:44.850
Yes, let's! <i> </i>

00:20:44.850 --> 00:20:46.450
Yes, let's! Don't be absurd!

00:20:46.600 --> 00:20:48.650
It's time to go home!

00:20:48.860 --> 00:20:51.320
What... Why can't we all have coffee?

00:20:51.590 --> 00:20:53.100
But don't you see?

00:20:53.100 --> 00:20:57.530
While we're drinking coffee, the sun will set!

00:20:59.460 --> 00:21:02.970
Before we know it, it'll be totally dark!

00:21:03.290 --> 00:21:04.600
No it won't!!

00:21:04.740 --> 00:21:05.940
Yes it will!!

00:21:06.070 --> 00:21:08.680
Let's go! Good bye!

00:21:10.010 --> 00:21:10.880
Mariko-san! <i> </i>

00:21:10.880 --> 00:21:12.750
Mariko-san! Wait a second! Shinobu-san!

00:21:13.010 --> 00:21:16.600
Oh! Oops! Thank you very much for today!

00:21:16.600 --> 00:21:16.950
You're welcome... <i> </i>

00:21:16.950 --> 00:21:18.480
You're welcome... Wait up!

00:21:18.690 --> 00:21:20.490
You're too fast! Wait!

00:21:20.490 --> 00:21:21.890
No, I won't wait!

00:21:22.090 --> 00:21:26.360
You don't know how men change into dangerous wolves after dark!

00:21:30.160 --> 00:21:32.160
What a girl!

00:21:32.630 --> 00:21:34.830
It must've been terrible being stuck with her.

00:21:35.240 --> 00:21:36.420
No...

00:21:37.900 --> 00:21:38.860
I kind of liked it.

00:21:39.060 --> 00:21:39.970
What?

00:21:41.040 --> 00:21:42.840
I got to liking her.

00:21:50.180 --> 00:21:52.590
Thank you Nanako!

00:21:52.590 --> 00:21:55.060
Because of you I had such a good time!

00:21:56.520 --> 00:21:57.920
Because of me?

00:21:58.060 --> 00:22:01.460
Yes! Because you became a sister of Henmi-sensei.

00:22:02.460 --> 00:22:03.660
That's right!

00:22:05.200 --> 00:22:09.600
But, Mariko-san was so uptight today.

00:22:09.740 --> 00:22:13.540
Her man-hating thing seems a little sick... I wonder why she does that...

00:22:13.540 --> 00:22:17.810
Well, there's a problem. A complex problem in her family.

00:22:17.940 --> 00:22:19.410
Is that so?

00:22:29.360 --> 00:22:30.960
No, no, no!

00:22:30.960 --> 00:22:34.030
The time flies when we're having fun,

00:22:34.030 --> 00:22:36.030
...but tomorrow, it's back to school again.

00:22:36.900 --> 00:22:38.100
...or so it seems...

00:22:38.830 --> 00:22:40.500
This is heavy!

00:22:42.470 --> 00:22:43.340
Yes!

00:22:44.640 --> 00:22:47.370
Apple tea, your favorite.

00:22:47.670 --> 00:22:48.980
Wow!

00:22:50.440 --> 00:22:52.450
How was it, at the university?

00:22:52.710 --> 00:22:55.720
I had fun! But there were so many people.

00:22:55.720 --> 00:22:57.650
It was a little overwhelming.

00:22:57.850 --> 00:23:02.320
Well. You're lucky you had someone to show you around.

00:23:02.560 --> 00:23:03.410
Yes!

00:23:07.130 --> 00:23:09.000
So... take your bath now.

00:23:09.200 --> 00:23:10.130
OK!

00:23:20.670 --> 00:23:22.810
Brother, Dear Brother...

00:23:25.410 --> 00:23:28.550
For the warmth of your company,

00:23:28.550 --> 00:23:31.600
...and this wonderful, gentle day together,

00:23:31.600 --> 00:23:34.220
...I would like to express my sincere gratitude.

00:23:35.490 --> 00:23:38.830
Thank you very very much!

00:24:10.160 --> 00:24:14.360
I dreamed I was chasing a rainbow...

00:24:14.360 --> 00:24:19.830
Then the rainbow I was chasing was you.

00:24:21.300 --> 00:24:25.440
Before, I had no strength, no will.

00:24:25.440 --> 00:24:30.910
But now because of you, I do.

00:24:31.650 --> 00:24:37.190
Feelings of love, like raindrops

00:24:37.190 --> 00:24:42.660
Come pouring from the sky.

00:24:42.660 --> 00:24:45.390
This is surely a game

00:24:45.390 --> 00:24:48.200
Of some mischievous fairy...

00:24:48.200 --> 00:24:50.600
Always dancing,

00:24:50.600 --> 00:24:55.870
Always capricious...

00:25:02.640 --> 00:25:04.250
Preview

00:25:04.710 --> 00:25:09.790
Visiting Fukiko's vacation home to help prepare for Fukiko's birthday party,

00:25:09.790 --> 00:25:13.720
...she is stunned to overhear Fukiko's mournful suffering.

00:25:14.060 --> 00:25:19.660
The following day, before Nanako's eyes, Fukiko jumps into the lake.

00:25:20.400 --> 00:25:21.480
Next episode: <i> </i>

00:25:21.480 --> 00:25:23.560
Next episode: <b>A Summer's Serenade</b>

00:25:24.000 --> 00:25:25.600
Brother, Dear Brother... <i> </i>

00:25:25.600 --> 00:25:28.340
Brother, Dear Brother... There is no end to my tears...
